WEBVTT

00:00:21.160 --> 00:00:24.080
I've found another girl that I like.

00:00:27.210 --> 00:00:31.840
She's an underclassman, but she's slender,
with long arms and legs.

00:00:31.840 --> 00:00:34.010
She's a model, actually.

00:00:34.010 --> 00:00:38.760
Airi, you're a reader model, so you're
a model, too, as far as it goes.

00:00:42.680 --> 00:00:46.810
But I mean, a <i>real</i> model is, you know, <i>thin</i>.

00:00:46.810 --> 00:00:49.820
Airi, you're getting pudgy
nowadays, aren't you?

00:00:51.360 --> 00:00:54.450
Sorry, but from now on, we're just friends.

00:01:46.000 --> 00:01:49.670
"The Witch of Gluttony"

00:01:59.890 --> 00:02:01.470
The curry is ready.

00:02:01.470 --> 00:02:02.970
Yay!

00:02:02.970 --> 00:02:06.140
We love your curry, Grandma!

00:02:06.140 --> 00:02:08.560
Thank you for this food!

00:02:13.690 --> 00:02:17.780
Special attack! Whee!

00:02:17.780 --> 00:02:18.950
Away you go!

00:02:18.950 --> 00:02:20.360
Away you go!

00:02:20.360 --> 00:02:23.370
Away you go!

00:02:23.370 --> 00:02:27.870
Freshness is the life of good ingredients!

00:02:29.160 --> 00:02:31.330
Here it comes!

00:02:33.340 --> 00:02:36.630
Candy Attack!

00:02:41.010 --> 00:02:44.600
Everything's ready! Whee!

00:02:46.140 --> 00:02:49.640
Now then, to start cooking!

00:02:52.480 --> 00:02:57.230
I'm going to keep turning them out! Whee!

00:03:00.070 --> 00:03:03.120
You're all looking tasty, too.

00:03:34.350 --> 00:03:35.520
You're tiny.

00:03:39.900 --> 00:03:43.530
Go!

00:03:43.530 --> 00:03:45.370
More! More!

00:03:45.370 --> 00:03:50.160
Whee! Whee! Whee! Whee! Whee!

00:03:55.920 --> 00:03:59.000
Let the whole world turn into candy!

00:04:09.390 --> 00:04:11.140
It was a dream?

00:04:51.850 --> 00:04:53.930
Oh well, off to work.

00:05:01.650 --> 00:05:03.400
Yum!

00:05:07.280 --> 00:05:09.070
"Now serving Airi's summer curry!!"

00:05:09.120 --> 00:05:13.620
Yum! Yum! Yummy! This is terrific!

00:05:14.620 --> 00:05:17.330
Excuse me, can I get another, please?

00:05:19.040 --> 00:05:24.010
For my money, this curry wins a place
in the greatest dish hall of fame.

00:05:24.010 --> 00:05:25.510
Here you go.

00:05:26.930 --> 00:05:30.640
♪ You, and me, and puppies, and kitties, ♪

00:05:30.640 --> 00:05:34.470
♪ everyone loves curry rice! ♪

00:05:34.470 --> 00:05:38.150
♪ Beef, chicken, pork, Keema, ♪

00:05:38.150 --> 00:05:41.900
♪ everyone loves curry rice! ♪

00:05:41.900 --> 00:05:43.860
♪ Curry rice! ♪

00:05:43.860 --> 00:05:47.360
♪ Curry rice! ♪

00:05:50.410 --> 00:05:53.200
I've found another girl that I like.

00:05:53.200 --> 00:05:55.750
She's an underclassman, but she's slender.

00:05:55.750 --> 00:05:59.830
But I mean, a <i>real</i> model is, you know, <i>thin</i>.

00:05:59.830 --> 00:06:03.000
Airi, you're getting pudgy
nowadays, aren't you?

00:06:04.050 --> 00:06:10.470
He calls me pudgy, but the last time
I had a donut was three years ago.

00:06:10.470 --> 00:06:14.720
I sure would like a donut. Like I <i>could</i>.

00:06:14.720 --> 00:06:18.390
I'm so careful, too, because
it's easy for me to get fat.

00:06:18.390 --> 00:06:20.440
Another, please!

00:06:20.440 --> 00:06:22.020
Okay!

00:06:23.190 --> 00:06:27.240
--♪ Grandpa, and Grandma,
and Brother, and Sister, ♪
--Airi, your curry has a lot of fans, huh?

00:06:27.240 --> 00:06:31.030
♪ everyone loves curry rice! ♪

00:06:53.600 --> 00:06:55.970
A cat and donuts...

00:07:05.520 --> 00:07:10.450
Wow... It's so hot every day.
Is it getting to you?

00:07:13.370 --> 00:07:19.200
Mmm, that's good. Delicious! <i>Buono</i>!

00:07:19.200 --> 00:07:20.660
Listen...

00:07:20.660 --> 00:07:23.750
Haruto, here, have a little taste.

00:07:23.750 --> 00:07:26.170
Nah, not right now.

00:07:26.170 --> 00:07:29.510
My dreams lately have been about
nothing but donuts and candy.

00:07:29.510 --> 00:07:34.850
Hmm, I was hoping you would
eat at least one of these, Haruto.

00:07:34.850 --> 00:07:37.260
You brought some curry yesterday, right?

00:07:37.260 --> 00:07:40.520
I've been on a curry kick lately.

00:07:40.520 --> 00:07:42.940
So, anything going on?

00:07:42.940 --> 00:07:48.150
No, not especially.
Anything going on with you?

00:07:48.150 --> 00:07:52.860
I've been going to this weird land
of candy every night, is all.

00:07:52.860 --> 00:07:56.030
Oh, but the weirdest thing
is that there's a cat

00:07:56.030 --> 00:07:58.870
who brings curry and donuts
to eat, every single day.

00:07:58.870 --> 00:08:01.960
That <i>is</i> an unusual cat, huh?

00:08:01.960 --> 00:08:05.170
♪ I love you, curry rice! ♪

00:08:05.170 --> 00:08:07.460
♪ Curry rice! ♪

00:08:07.460 --> 00:08:08.960
Go away!

00:08:08.960 --> 00:08:11.010
These are huge.

00:08:11.010 --> 00:08:12.340
What are these?

00:08:13.340 --> 00:08:15.590
A parting gift from the cat.

00:08:15.590 --> 00:08:17.470
These are way huge!

00:08:17.470 --> 00:08:19.890
I love these!

00:08:19.890 --> 00:08:22.140
La-la-la donuts!

00:08:23.600 --> 00:08:26.190
You really are just a kid.

00:08:26.190 --> 00:08:30.780
Brother! All girls love snacks!

00:08:31.820 --> 00:08:33.990
Brother! Brother!

00:08:33.990 --> 00:08:35.360
The donuts are multiplying!

00:08:35.360 --> 00:08:37.320
Huh?!

00:08:37.320 --> 00:08:39.620
Brother, let's go!

00:08:39.620 --> 00:08:41.290
Hold up.

00:08:41.290 --> 00:08:43.540
Whee-whee! Whee-whee!

00:08:47.000 --> 00:08:49.000
Lily!

00:08:51.710 --> 00:08:53.470
Where did you go?!

00:08:56.180 --> 00:08:58.720
What the hell is this?

00:09:03.480 --> 00:09:05.520
Lily!

00:09:12.320 --> 00:09:15.950
Ugh... I'm more-or-less getting used to this.

00:09:18.160 --> 00:09:19.160
Huh?

00:09:22.490 --> 00:09:24.500
--There's no taste.
--There's no taste.

00:09:26.080 --> 00:09:29.290
--I still need to find Lily.
--Donuts! Whee-whee!

00:09:39.260 --> 00:09:40.970
A soy-flour donut?

00:09:43.220 --> 00:09:45.980
Ow! Ow! Ow!

00:09:50.060 --> 00:09:53.900
Lily, that hurts, that hurts, that hurts!
I don't taste that good!

00:10:02.160 --> 00:10:05.080
I can't eat any more.

00:10:05.080 --> 00:10:09.040
This Brother-donut is a hit.

00:10:09.040 --> 00:10:10.210
For Pete's sake.

00:10:10.210 --> 00:10:15.630
Haruto, you seem to be going out
with Lily every night lately.

00:10:17.920 --> 00:10:19.880
What are you eating?!

00:10:22.800 --> 00:10:27.180
The limited edition "My Summer
Curry," in the big size.

00:10:27.180 --> 00:10:31.480
Man, I'm on a curry kick lately. Want some?

00:10:31.480 --> 00:10:34.770
Nah, I just stuffed myself with donuts.

00:10:34.770 --> 00:10:36.940
Wait, isn't that cup ramen too hot for you?

00:10:36.940 --> 00:10:38.950
You <i>do</i> have a cat's tongue after all.

00:10:38.950 --> 00:10:41.110
No, I don't have a cat's tongue.

00:10:41.110 --> 00:10:44.240
--Lily?
--I can eat both hot ramen and hot curry just fine.

00:10:44.240 --> 00:10:48.250
Nothing beats curry in the summer.
Don't you think so, Haruto?

00:10:48.250 --> 00:10:52.040
I'm all about the limited-time curry
this one coffee shop has now.

00:10:52.040 --> 00:10:54.630
I'm telling you, it's the
absolute gold standard food.

00:10:54.630 --> 00:10:58.210
Every day, I just can't rest
until I've had some.

00:10:58.210 --> 00:11:03.050
The secret ingredient in that shop's
curry has to be bonito flakes.

00:11:06.680 --> 00:11:08.520
Hurry along, now.

00:11:08.520 --> 00:11:09.930
Oh, right...

00:11:09.930 --> 00:11:11.650
On the subject of bonito flakes,

00:11:11.650 --> 00:11:13.860
they have nine kinds of
essential amino acids

00:11:13.860 --> 00:11:16.020
that your body can't produce on its own.

00:11:16.020 --> 00:11:18.230
Tryptophan, in particular, is an amino acid

00:11:18.230 --> 00:11:21.610
which is needed to produce
a neurotransmitter called serotonin.

00:11:21.610 --> 00:11:23.780
My point being...

00:11:23.780 --> 00:11:26.910
If you keep on eating their curry,
it will help you relieve stress

00:11:26.910 --> 00:11:32.250
and alleviate any insomnia.
Man, it's fantastic.

00:11:40.090 --> 00:11:43.010
The fourth witch, huh?

00:11:55.980 --> 00:11:58.530
Thank you for this food!

00:12:15.170 --> 00:12:16.580
--More!
--More!

00:12:16.580 --> 00:12:20.260
Grandma, we love your curry!

00:12:20.260 --> 00:12:22.970
--It's yummy!
--It's yummy, isn't it?

00:12:35.560 --> 00:12:39.570
Grandma's curry... That takes me back.

00:12:39.570 --> 00:12:42.650
She put in lots of tomatoes, right?

00:12:42.650 --> 00:12:47.030
Every August, I would always
go and stay with Grandma.

00:12:49.410 --> 00:12:52.700
I made curry with Grandma a lot.

00:12:52.700 --> 00:12:57.960
It was full of onions, potatoes,
carrots, eggplant, and tomatoes.

00:12:57.960 --> 00:13:01.590
I was so happy to make it with Grandma.

00:13:12.350 --> 00:13:14.140
When I got into high school,

00:13:14.140 --> 00:13:19.860
and started as a reader model,
I got so busy that I wasn't able to go.

00:13:19.860 --> 00:13:23.740
I sure wished I could make curry
with Grandma once again.

00:13:28.030 --> 00:13:33.080
Grandma, it's a popular menu item
at Uncle's coffee shop.

00:13:33.080 --> 00:13:35.620
Someone even comes in for it every day.

00:13:53.430 --> 00:13:55.230
It's gone up?

00:13:55.230 --> 00:13:59.730
That's strange. It's so hot,
I'm not even eating very much.

00:14:09.070 --> 00:14:12.700
♪ Katsumi loves his curry! ♪

00:14:14.540 --> 00:14:18.330
Mmm, as good as always! Another, please!

00:14:23.290 --> 00:14:25.510
Yum! Yum!

00:14:25.510 --> 00:14:27.720
Another, please!

00:14:27.720 --> 00:14:29.010
Okay.

00:14:29.010 --> 00:14:32.350
--♪ Everyone loves curry rice! ♪

00:14:32.350 --> 00:14:32.850
--He's in fine form again today, huh?
--♪ Everyone loves curry rice! ♪

00:14:32.850 --> 00:14:38.430
--He's in fine form again today, huh?
--♪ Katsumi loves his curry! Katsumi! ♪

00:14:37.600 --> 00:14:39.480
"Airi, you have 5 kg to go
to reach your ideal weight"

00:15:09.880 --> 00:15:13.760
Yay! This place is full of donuts!

00:15:13.760 --> 00:15:16.180
How long is this going to go on?!

00:15:16.180 --> 00:15:18.600
Come on, wake up from this dream!

00:15:18.600 --> 00:15:21.190
Away you go! Whee-whee!

00:15:23.310 --> 00:15:26.230
<i>Everything</i> turn into candy!

00:15:35.580 --> 00:15:38.450
Hmm? This tastes different.

00:15:40.910 --> 00:15:43.420
Thank you for waiting.

00:15:43.420 --> 00:15:48.250
You really do love curry, don't you?
Thanks for always coming in.

00:15:51.090 --> 00:15:54.010
I like how you put so many tomatoes in it.

00:16:15.950 --> 00:16:18.790
I can't take these donuts anymore!

00:16:19.990 --> 00:16:23.290
In this world, no matter
how much you eat, it's okay!

00:16:23.290 --> 00:16:26.330
I've had enough! I want to go home!

00:16:26.330 --> 00:16:29.960
You eat, and eat, and never get fat.

00:16:29.960 --> 00:16:31.760
That sounds terrific.

00:16:31.760 --> 00:16:33.220
Brother...

00:16:33.220 --> 00:16:36.220
I'm... leaving.

00:16:37.640 --> 00:16:38.680
Whoa, wait!

00:16:51.990 --> 00:16:54.650
Would you mind undoing these?

00:16:54.650 --> 00:16:57.240
Can I eat you?

00:16:57.240 --> 00:16:59.330
Did you hear what I said?

00:16:59.330 --> 00:17:01.620
Mm-hmm.

00:17:01.620 --> 00:17:04.710
I'm the queen of the Land of Donuts!

00:17:06.170 --> 00:17:07.380
Listen...

00:17:07.380 --> 00:17:13.050
More donuts. More candy. Let's eat... more...

00:17:15.010 --> 00:17:19.600
I want to eat, but I'm not sure I should.

00:17:19.600 --> 00:17:21.930
Donuts, cotton candy...

00:17:21.930 --> 00:17:24.980
Soft. Ice. Cream.

00:17:24.980 --> 00:17:28.770
Chocolate, candy, jellies, love...

00:17:28.770 --> 00:17:32.530
I can eat and eat, and still
have a knockout figure...

00:17:34.530 --> 00:17:38.870
I want to eat, but I'm not sure I should.

00:17:38.870 --> 00:17:41.240
Can I eat you?!

00:17:41.240 --> 00:17:44.160
Whee! Whee!

00:18:28.540 --> 00:18:30.920
--Thank you for this food!
--Thank you for this food!

00:18:35.590 --> 00:18:37.840
Whoo! More, please!

00:18:40.260 --> 00:18:42.260
This curry is top-notch!

00:18:42.260 --> 00:18:43.350
Huh?

00:18:45.010 --> 00:18:46.350
You're not eating?

00:18:47.350 --> 00:18:49.730
Aren't you hungry?

00:18:51.980 --> 00:18:53.400
It's good.

00:18:56.650 --> 00:18:59.280
It may be good, but...

00:18:59.280 --> 00:19:01.530
But...?

00:19:01.530 --> 00:19:04.030
If I eat it, I'll lose weight.

00:19:04.030 --> 00:19:05.370
You'll lose weight?

00:19:06.410 --> 00:19:09.620
Does eating and losing weight bother you?

00:19:09.620 --> 00:19:11.870
Mm-hmm.

00:19:11.870 --> 00:19:14.670
When I eat, I lose weight in a hurry.

00:19:14.670 --> 00:19:16.800
And losing weight is a bad thing?

00:19:16.800 --> 00:19:19.420
Yes, it is.

00:19:19.420 --> 00:19:25.270
When I ate and lost weight,
my boyfriend dumped me.

00:19:28.940 --> 00:19:31.860
Why don't you try having just one bite?

00:19:34.210 --> 00:19:36.200
Whether you lose weight or gain it,

00:19:36.200 --> 00:19:38.910
it's no fun if you can't
enjoy your meal, is it?

00:20:27.680 --> 00:20:32.050
That's so good! And so fun!

00:21:10.340 --> 00:21:13.430
Another dish, and some coffee, please!

00:21:13.430 --> 00:21:15.590
Okay!

00:21:15.590 --> 00:21:19.690
Oh, he's in fine form again today, huh?

00:21:19.690 --> 00:21:23.310
He sure does seem to
enjoy eating, doesn't he?

00:21:24.770 --> 00:21:28.560
♪ You, and me, and puppies, and kitties, ♪

00:21:28.560 --> 00:21:31.990
♪ everyone loves curry rice! ♪

00:21:31.990 --> 00:21:36.110
--I'm going to find a new love!
--♪ Beef, chicken, pork, Keema, ♪

00:21:36.110 --> 00:21:36.900
--♪ everyone loves curry rice! ♪

00:21:36.900 --> 00:21:40.040
--Whoa, Airi...?
--♪ everyone loves curry rice! ♪

00:21:40.040 --> 00:21:44.000
♪ Grandpa, and Grandma,
and Brother, and Sister, ♪

00:21:44.000 --> 00:21:48.050
♪ everyone loves curry rice! ♪

00:21:48.050 --> 00:21:49.920
♪ Curry rice! ♪

00:21:49.920 --> 00:21:53.350
♪ Curry rice! ♪

00:21:58.000 --> 00:22:09.820
<i>In a halo-shaped donut,</i>
<i>in cream soda, I dissolve</i>

00:22:09.820 --> 00:22:21.860
<i>Which should I pick, a love life prediction</i>
<i>or a weather forecast?</i>

00:22:34.260 --> 00:22:46.170
<i>The spiral staircase in the mirror</i>
<i>is covered in icing</i>

00:22:46.170 --> 00:22:58.780
<i>In my dreams, the world is pastel</i>

00:22:58.780 --> 00:23:10.200
<i>The truth is, I don’t know</i>
<i>if the truth is true</i>

00:23:10.200 --> 00:23:25.930
<i>My only guidepost is the</i> <i>warmth</i>
<i>I feel in my heart</i>

00:23:29.590 --> 00:23:33.240
If there were a path you could take,
different from your current one,

00:23:33.240 --> 00:23:34.940
would you want to take it?

00:23:34.940 --> 00:23:37.440
Yes I would, baa!

00:23:35.680 --> 00:23:41.440
"The Witch of Ordinariness"

00:23:37.440 --> 00:23:41.440
Next time's dream is
"The Witch of Ordinariness."
